<title>USA: Bristol Hotel starts share offering.</title>
<headline>Bristol Hotel starts share offering.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bristol Hotel Co said in a statement that it has started an offering of 2.872 million shares following a $500 million shelf registration program which became effective on April 22.</p>
<p>Bristol said that the company would use the funds to develop hotels, acquire businesses and for general corporate purposes.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsroom 212 859-1902))</p>
